# Optional development setup: copy to `.env` and supply your own key.
# Most users should use Settings → AI connection instead.
# `.env` is gitignored — never commit a real key.
#
# Enables Smart Rename and natural-language rules. Without it the app runs
# normally: Smart Rename falls back to local filename heuristics, and the
# AI command bar reports that the feature is unavailable.
#
# Create a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
